2L12.477 1.34327C12.4269 1.19375 12.3095 1.0764 12.16 1.02625C11.8966 0.937894 11.6114 1.07983 11.523 1.34327L8.91088 9.13158H0.503157C0.33975 9.13158 0.186521 9.21094 0.0922364 9.3444C-0.0680877 9.57134 -0.0140806 9.88529 0.212865 10.0456L7.00408 14.8432L4.40172 22.6166C4.35092 22.7683 4.37534 22.9352 4.46749 23.066C4.6275 23.2932 4.94137 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3410779642">August 8, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">What do you get when you have - one snarky woman with a few secrets about her past, who just wants to live a normal quiet life, and one prince who has a few secrets of his own, plus some crazy relatives on both their parts? You get a fun, quirky, enjoyable story by Carol Moncado.<br />Carol Moncado is an expert in writing stories that will take you deep into the lives of “royalty” and the world of “royals.” Guess what, she’s done it again! This book is packed full of “royal” moments. I couldn’t put this book down.<br />This is a new series by this author, but yet it has a few friends from some of her other series. The fun new twist she’s put in this one is that there is a story within this story. She has developed a whole new literary world within this current world and we find fun plots regarding it. The characters are fascinated with the book series that is so ingrained in their lives. The whole country seems to know all about the books, yet there is a mystery surrounding them. <br />I love this book and can’t wait to read more about many of these characters in the future! I think I'll read any book this author writes because they are always full of sweet romance and wonderful life lessons, with a bit of suspense.<br />I was given this book by the author which did not influence my review in any way, all thoughts and opinions are my own.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/28126915?shelf=books-reviewed" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">books-reviewed</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/28126915?shelf=own-kindle" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">own-kindle</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">1 like</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.498061