.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3493302965">August 13, 2020</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This is the first book in Mrs. Moncado’s new series, Princes of New Sargasso. This book focuses on Prince Gideon of New Sargasso. In an impromptu meeting, he meets Karsen. They notice the spark between them initially, but Karsen also knows her privacy will end if the public realizes that she is dating Gideon. This book has several interesting twists and turns (and surprises)! There is even a mystery included in the storyline besides just the romantic aspect of the book. Mrs. Moncado also has the storyline of the Trilunium Chronicles which is an imaginary set of books that were written by M. Karson many years prior to the setting of this book. Details from within these books provide readers with another storyline and world that has previously not been in these books. The book as a whole is a sweet royalty romance if you like to read this genre. If you have read Mrs. Moncado’s previous books, you will love this new series! If you haven’t read her books, I would encourage you to try this one! I highly recommend this book! I loved the storyline, additional backstory, and am eagerly awaiting the next book in the series!</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div