second son, but no one knows that his older brother isn't able to be king and when the time comes it will be Gideon who takes the throne.<br /><br />Karsen has a jaded background where her parents are concerned, and even before she came of age to be on her own she was part of their scams, unknowingly helping them. When she meets Gideon she knows that at some point that part of her life was going to be a hindrance to their relationship - especially after he tells her the family secret. <br /><br />Gideon and Karsen hit it off immediately and really like one another, but Karsen has no idea how dating a prince is going to affect her everyday life. And that there is a woman of noble birth telling everyone she and Gideon are talking marriage doesn't help either. Is this going to work out? You're going to have to read it to find out.<br /><br />This is a clean read, although there are some strong slang terms in it.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.7092072 C19.4523479,14.2722622 19.4523479,14.9350066 19.1708204,15.4980616 L19,15.8397024 L19,16.