s.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1532384752i/28126915._UX200_CR0,50,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":46,"textReviewsCount":1380,"name":"Marylin","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/28126915-marylin","contributor":null,"id":28126915},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/28126915?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"own-kindle","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/28126915?shelf=own-kindle"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"books-reviewed","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/28126915?shelf=books-reviewed"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3410779642"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.l0YNd8cIQg38-cGlTlIhDQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.l0YNd8cIQg38-cGlTlIhDQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:28126915"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1596923280392,"createdAt":1596914734244,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1596914775037,"text":"What do you get when you have - one snarky woman with a few secrets about her past, who just wants to live a normal quiet life, and one prince who has a few secrets of his own, plus some crazy relatives on both their parts? You get a fun, quirky, enjoyable story by Carol Moncado.\u003cbr /\u003eCarol Moncado is an expert in writing stories that will take you deep into the lives of “royalty” and the world of “royals.” Guess what, she’s done it again! This book is packed full of “royal” moments. I couldn’t put this book down.\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a new series by this author, but yet it has a few friends from some of her other series. The fun new twist she’s put in this one is that there is a story within this story. She has developed a whole new literary world within this current world and we find fun plots regarding it. The characters are fascinated with the book series that is so ingrained in their lives. The whole country seems to know all about the books, yet there is a mystery surrounding them. \u003cbr /\u003eI love this book and can’t wait to read more about many of these characters in the future! I think I'll read any book this author writes because they are always full of sweet romance and wonderful life lessons, with a bit of suspense.\u003cbr /\u003eI was given this book by the author which did not influence my review in any way, all thoughts and opinions are my own.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1RZS6GH0AWFEJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:58593701":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":58593701,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":228,"name":"Amy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/58593701-amy","contributor":null,"id":58593701},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AM5N6LG7VXFY6":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AM5N6LG7VXFY6"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AM5N6LG7VXFY6\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AM5N6LG7VXFY6","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AM5N6LG7VXFY6"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/58593701?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3493302965"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uU1chx9fG69ZrHrFn1GGvA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.uU1chx9fG69ZrHrFn1GGvA","creator":{"__ref":"User:58593701"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1597285180751,"createdAt":1597285166030,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1597285180524,"text":"This is the first book in Mrs. Moncado’s new series, Princes of New Sargasso. This book focuses on Prince Gideon of New Sargasso. In an impromptu meeting, he meets Karsen. They notice the spark between them initially, but Karsen also knows her privacy will end if the public realizes that she is dating Gideon. This book has several interesting twists and turns (and surprises)! There is even a mystery included in the storyline besides just the romantic aspect of the book. Mrs. Moncado also has the storyline of the Trilunium Chronicles which is an imaginary set of books that were written by M. Karson many years prior to the setting of this book. Details from within these books provide readers with another storyline and world that has previously not been in these books. The book as a whole is a sweet royalty romance if you like to read this genre. If you have read Mrs. Moncado’s previous books, you will love this new series! If you haven’t read her books, I would encourage you to try this one! I highly recommend this book! I loved the storyline, additional backstory, and am eagerly awaiting the next book in the series!","rating":5,"