second son, but no one knows that his older brother isn't able to be king and when the time comes it will be Gideon who takes the throne.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eKarsen has a jaded background where her parents are concerned, and even before she came of age to be on her own she was part of their scams, unknowingly helping them. When she meets Gideon she knows that at some point that part of her life was going to be a hindrance to their relationship - especially after he tells her the family secret. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGideon and Karsen hit it off immediately and really like one another, but Karsen has no idea how dating a prince is going to affect her everyday life. And that there is a woman of noble birth telling everyone she and Gideon are talking marriage doesn't help either. Is this going to work out? You're going to have to read it to find out.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is a clean read, although there are some strong slang terms in it.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1MSOC5SD81FV5\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:82860014":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":82860014,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1614790108i/82860014._UX200_CR0,22,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":2,"textReviewsCount":67,"name":"Brandy Hatchel","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/82860014-brandy-hatchel","contributor":null,"id":82860014},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/82860014?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3491154696"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hhjSx8Jnx5gciFJFoefqXA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.hhjSx8Jnx5gciFJFoefqXA","creator":{"__ref":"User:82860014"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1597179512737,"createdAt":1597179003060,"spoilerStatus":true,"lastRevisionAt":1597179512493,"text":"It’s always those who fight the hardest who fall...\u003cbr /\u003eA difficult past has left Kari with a lot of scars and pain. She hides it well in her life working and volunteering to try to pay others back. So many circumstances push her towards the prince. He is delighted by her and she is just what he needs. Someone who cares for him not the title. Will she be able to move past her past towards a happy future? \u003cbr /\u003eMs. Moncado also adds a lovely sub plot of a CS Lewis/ Tolkien world in the book. I believe they say it will follow through for several books. \u003cbr /\u003eI loved this book. Ms. Moncado writes the most beautiful happy ever afters. She includes everything you want in them. A little bit of mystery, suspense, the bad villain characters and of course the happy. I will always be eager to read the next book she puts out. I already can’t wait until the next one. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1LNUALG73RJLZ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:95988305":{"__typename":