ll,"updatedAt":1603682830061,"createdAt":1603670298579,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1603682829747,"text":"\u003cstrong\u003eKari's Unlikely Date \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat a remarkable royal romance. Kari was simply a waitress in a small, but good restaurant. Following a Charity event, Prince Gideon made an impronto stop just as he was the topic of conversation by a frequent customer. She made the remark about what beautiful children they would have together! To say the least, Kari was mortified and even horrified! But Prince Gideon was intrigued by the beautiful young lady's reaction to the statement. He asked Kari out, but she just about said \"No\" for a number of reasons which wasn't a normal experience for the Prince. It wasn't that he was a player, but he certainly wasn't used to rejection either. However, Kari's story is unlike any I have ever read. I loved it and believe you will as well. Happy reading!","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A204QV8J9751AH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}"},"likeCount":0,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:90738008":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":90738008,"imageUrlSquare":"","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":0,"textReviewsCount":90,"name":"Julie G","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/90738008-julie-g","contributor":null,"id":90738008},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANC83PVPEDZXH":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANC83PVPEDZXH"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ANC83PVPEDZXH\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ANC83PVPEDZXH","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ANC83PVPEDZXH"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0FtN7jLXffzX56bc","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.0Ft